From 02b6a2303d66b0c895344c4e8baf360e4cf9d769 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Intel MPSS <mpss@intel.invalid>
Date: Mon, 1 Jul 2019 22:45:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/49] x86_64: access MXCSR and raise FP exceptions through
 sysdep.h hooks

[2.39: only the FP exception raising and the sysdep.h includes remain;
ldmxcsr/stmxcsr are valid on K1OM.]

[2.31: setcontext/swapcontext keep ldmxcsr (valid on K1OM; only L1OM
overrode LOAD_MXCSR).]

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Anselm Busse <anselm.busse@outlook.com>
